quran[11]{c,v,t}:
  21,91,"And (call to mind) that (embodiment of purity) Maryam ([Mary] as well) who guarded her chastity. Then We breathed into her of Our Spirit, and We made her and her son (‘Isa [Jesus]) a sign (of Our power) for the people of the world."
  21,92,"Surely, these (people) are your Umma ([Community] and all) are one Umma. And I am your Lord, so worship Me (alone)."
  21,93,And these (People of the Book) split up their Din [Religion] into pieces amongst themselves. To Us they all will return.
  21,94,"So whoever does good deeds and is a believer as well, (the reward of) his effort will not be refused, and surely We are writing down (all) his deeds."
  21,95,"And it is not possible that the people of the town whom We destroyed will not return to Us (after death),"
  21,96,"Until when Gog and Magog are let loose, and they will come down running from every high place,"
  21,97,"And the true promise (of the Day of Resurrection) will draw near, then the eyes of the disbelievers will suddenly fix staring (and they will cry out:) ‘Woe to us! We were indeed oblivious of (the arrival of) this (Day); in fact, we were unjust.’"
  21,98,"Surely, you and (the idols) you worship besides Allah (all) are the fuel of Hell. You are going to enter it."
  21,99,"Had they been (true) gods, they would not have entered Hell. And all of them will stay in it forever."
  21,100,"There will be their (sighing and wailing, a) roar of screaming in it, and they will not be able to hear in it anything (else)."
  21,101,"Surely, those for whom good has already been decreed from Us will be kept away from (Hell)."
